WEBVTT

00:01.660 --> 00:05.250
<b>TOKAIDO
SURUGA UTSUNOYA MOUNTAIN PASS</b>

00:06.380 --> 00:11.720
<b>I appreciate you tagging along
to go visit my father's grave, Chugo.</b>

00:13.050 --> 00:14.510
<b>Chief!</b>

00:14.680 --> 00:15.680
<b>I'm exhausted.</b>

00:15.850 --> 00:17.560
<b>-Want to come by?
-Of course.</b>

00:17.720 --> 00:19.310
<b>Did you see that?</b>

00:19.470 --> 00:22.440
<b>They're another species
compared to the women of Edo.</b>

00:22.600 --> 00:27.570
<b>Something about their wildness
gets me excited and extremely curious.</b>

00:28.320 --> 00:29.940
<b>Aren't you hungry, chief?</b>

00:30.110 --> 00:33.610
<b>What's the specialty around here?</b>

00:34.490 --> 00:36.490
<b>Hey, Chugo.</b>

00:36.740 --> 00:38.620
<b>-Yes?
-Let's part ways here.</b>

00:39.490 --> 00:41.450
<b>I'll catch up later.</b>

00:41.620 --> 00:43.250
<b>I'll meet you at the Relay Station.</b>

00:43.870 --> 00:45.420
<b>No, I can't allow that.</b>

00:46.210 --> 00:49.840
<b>Your wife specifically requested
that I accompany you at all times.</b>

00:50.000 --> 00:52.420
<b>I won't break that promise.</b>

00:53.170 --> 00:55.260
<b>Hisae.</b>

00:59.970 --> 01:02.600
<b>I'm a member of the Arson Theft Control.</b>

01:02.770 --> 01:09.230
<b>-I won't fall for bribery.
-Take this and go explore the women here.</b>

01:09.400 --> 01:11.940
<b>Why don't you go fulfill that curiosity, huh?</b>

01:17.360 --> 01:19.740
<b>Chugo, that was way too easy.</b>

01:20.200 --> 01:22.240
<b>But I finally get some peace and quiet.</b>

02:28.640 --> 02:33.440
<b>Secret Theft Tactics</b>

02:46.950 --> 02:49.540
<b>Who the heck are you?</b>

02:59.010 --> 03:02.470
<b>I'm the magistrate who runs
the Mitsuke Relay Station of Enshu.</b>

03:02.640 --> 03:05.600
<b>The name is Jinzo Numata!</b>

03:05.760 --> 03:10.310
<b>And you, why do you defend the criminals?</b>

03:11.900 --> 03:13.900
<b>-Criminals?
-Precisely.</b>

03:14.060 --> 03:16.900
<b>These two are servants of Ichigoro Masuya</b>

03:17.070 --> 03:21.110
<b>who runs the sake brewery in Mitsuke,
Tadaroku and Omoyo.</b>

03:21.570 --> 03:27.580
<b>Strangely, they robbed their boss,
Ichigoro's money, and ran off together.</b>

03:27.750 --> 03:30.080
<b>They're extremely reprehensible subjects.</b>

03:30.580 --> 03:32.420
<b>So that's the story.</b>

03:34.670 --> 03:37.250
<b>Is it true?</b>

03:59.820 --> 04:03.410
<b>My, what a spectacle that was,</b>

04:03.570 --> 04:04.570
<b>boss.</b>

04:06.910 --> 04:09.660
<b>I witnessed your skills back there.</b>

04:09.830 --> 04:12.040
<b>That was mighty impressive.</b>

04:12.210 --> 04:14.380
<b>I was astonished.</b>

04:14.540 --> 04:17.340
<b>Boss, you must be a famous samurai,
am I right?</b>

04:17.500 --> 04:21.170
<b>-I've attracted another nuisance.
-Am I right?</b>

04:21.340 --> 04:24.890
<b>Hey. Give me a second here, boss.</b>

04:25.550 --> 04:27.970
<b>My name's Zenpachi.</b>

04:28.140 --> 04:32.310
<b>I'm always around here for business.</b>

04:34.600 --> 04:39.730
<b>-Delicious.
-And about that man, Ichigoro Masuya,</b>

04:39.900 --> 04:44.450
<b>besides brewing sake,
he lends money and runs brothels.</b>

04:44.950 --> 04:48.830
<b>He's a notorious one around here.</b>

04:48.990 --> 04:51.830
<b>He starves, and has no respect, for his servants.</b>

04:52.000 --> 04:55.040
<b>He treats them worse than livestock.</b>

04:55.210 --> 04:58.380
<b>They were only trying to escape from such hell.</b>

04:58.540 --> 05:02.340
<b>And the money they robbed?
It was a mere 2 ryo. Two.</b>

05:03.340 --> 05:06.680
<b>Can't imagine the hell they've endured.</b>

05:06.840 --> 05:08.760
<b>Right, boss?</b>

05:08.930 --> 05:10.640
<b>Where'd he go?</b>

05:12.220 --> 05:13.810
<b>Sorry, old man.</b>

05:14.180 --> 05:18.020
<b>It's my first solitary journey in a while.
I'm going my own way.</b>

05:19.110 --> 05:20.860
<b>In any case,</b>

05:21.900 --> 05:27.200
<b>I was completely unaware of that man's presence.</b>

05:31.030 --> 05:33.250
<b>Shimaya Inn</b>

05:42.300 --> 05:44.300
<b>Hey, boss.</b>

05:44.470 --> 05:46.380
<b>May I wash your back?</b>

05:46.550 --> 05:48.840
<b>Oh, why not?</b>

05:49.010 --> 05:50.220
<b>That's right.</b>

05:54.350 --> 05:57.190
<b>You've got quite a build.</b>

05:57.350 --> 05:59.940
<b>Boss, how many have you killed so far?</b>

06:00.110 --> 06:02.730
<b>Oh, I've lost count.</b>

06:02.900 --> 06:06.570
<b>As if it doesn't matter. You fascinate me.</b>

06:08.030 --> 06:12.580
<b>Boss, can't you at least tell me your name?</b>

06:17.620 --> 06:19.580
<b>It's Kimura.</b>

06:22.420 --> 06:23.920
<b>Heizo Kimura.</b>

06:24.090 --> 06:26.010
<b>Heizo Kimura?</b>

06:26.170 --> 06:29.430
<b>Cool name. What a great name.</b>

06:29.890 --> 06:33.260
<b>So, Mr. Kimura, where are you off to now?</b>

06:33.430 --> 06:37.270
<b>I've no destination. That's how I live.</b>

06:37.430 --> 06:40.940
<b>I see. A life without a destination.</b>

06:41.100 --> 06:43.940
<b>I like you even more now, Mr. Kimura.</b>

06:44.110 --> 06:45.900
<b>No, Mr. Hei.</b>

06:46.070 --> 06:47.780
<b>"Mr. Hei"? That's a first.</b>

06:48.610 --> 06:49.610
<b>Amazing.</b>

06:49.780 --> 06:52.280
<b>Oh, it's nothing special.</b>

06:52.450 --> 06:55.120
<b>Mr. Hei-- No, Mr. Heizo Kimura.</b>

06:55.290 --> 06:57.370
<b>What is it?</b>

06:57.540 --> 07:01.380
<b>Earlier, you mentioned
how you don't have a destination.</b>

07:01.540 --> 07:06.420
<b>In this day and age, a ronin like me is disposable.</b>

07:06.590 --> 07:10.760
<b>I've no dreams or hope for the future.</b>

07:11.640 --> 07:16.970
<b>Mr. Kimura, what do you say,
will you help me out with my business?</b>

07:17.140 --> 07:19.060
<b>Sure. What is it?</b>

07:20.310 --> 07:22.270
<b>It's a robbery job.</b>

07:23.980 --> 07:27.480
<b>I'm also known as Zenpachi of Isuga.</b>

07:27.650 --> 07:30.450
<b>I've done all of my jobs alone so far,</b>

07:30.610 --> 07:34.030
<b>but I can't help notice your potential,
Mr. Kimura.</b>

07:34.700 --> 07:36.030
<b>So, what do you say?</b>

07:41.670 --> 07:44.750
<b>Mr. Hei, this is a serious inquiry.</b>

07:45.250 --> 07:48.960
<b>Sorry. I wasn't expecting this at all.</b>

07:50.670 --> 07:53.510
<b>All right then. Sounds like fun.</b>

07:53.680 --> 07:58.180
<b>-Then?
-Yeah. If I can help, use me as you wish.</b>

07:58.350 --> 08:01.890
<b>That's great. I'm glad to have you on board.</b>

08:02.060 --> 08:03.690
<b>Now, drink up.</b>

08:05.020 --> 08:06.570
<b>But let me warn you, Mr. Hei.</b>

08:06.730 --> 08:10.360
<b>You cannot kill, and you can't rape women.</b>

08:10.530 --> 08:13.200
<b>Most importantly,</b>

08:13.360 --> 08:19.200
<b>you can't rob from the virtuous
who make a living by doing good.</b>

08:19.750 --> 08:24.710
<b>We only target those who are cruel
and bring misery to others.</b>

08:24.880 --> 08:28.750
<b>We're only interested in their money, you see?</b>

08:29.250 --> 08:31.760
<b>Sounds like common sense to me.</b>

08:32.170 --> 08:35.800
<b>All right. Let's drink to that as a pledge.</b>

08:36.800 --> 08:39.600
<b>Let's tackle our first job now.</b>

08:39.770 --> 08:42.060
<b>-Our target--
-Is it Ichigoro Masuya?</b>

08:42.230 --> 08:45.600
<b>You got it, Mr. Hei. You catch on quickly.</b>

08:51.280 --> 08:55.740
<b>So, Mr. Hei, as you know,
that's Numata the magistrate,</b>

08:55.910 --> 08:58.080
<b>and the idiot next to him is--</b>

08:58.240 --> 09:01.750
<b>-The owner of Masuya, Ichigoro Masuya.
-Yes.</b>

09:04.790 --> 09:06.500
<b>Did you catch that?</b>

09:06.670 --> 09:12.090
<b>That Numata overlooks Ichigoro's cruel doings</b>

09:12.260 --> 09:15.180
<b>and takes away those who resist him to the police.</b>

09:15.340 --> 09:17.930
<b>He's a problematic one, you see?</b>

09:18.100 --> 09:21.970
<b>Anyway, I just despise those government officials.</b>

09:22.140 --> 09:26.560
<b>They act big only to bully the weak.</b>

09:26.730 --> 09:28.400
<b>Don't you agree, Mr. Hei?</b>

09:31.440 --> 09:34.360
<b>Never mind that,
how about the two who got taken back?</b>

09:34.530 --> 09:36.150
<b>I wonder what happened to them.</b>

09:36.910 --> 09:41.740
<b>They're probably confined somewhere
and getting punished for attempting to escape</b>

09:41.910 --> 09:44.540
<b>to teach them a lesson.</b>

09:45.830 --> 09:49.840
<b>I actually robbed Masuya five years ago.</b>

09:50.210 --> 09:53.380
<b>It's been five years. Can you really do this?</b>

09:53.550 --> 09:56.300
<b>It'd be a bore to use the same method as last time.</b>

09:56.470 --> 09:58.140
<b>I'll come up with something.</b>

09:58.680 --> 10:00.470
<b>How about the two servants?</b>

10:00.640 --> 10:01.930
<b>We're not saving them?</b>

10:02.100 --> 10:04.770
<b>Don't be mistaken, Mr. Hei.</b>

10:04.930 --> 10:06.600
<b>We're thieves, after all.</b>

10:06.770 --> 10:09.400
<b>As long as we get the money, we're good.</b>

10:10.770 --> 10:12.650
<b>Is that so?</b>

10:13.480 --> 10:14.650
<b>Secret Theft Tactics</b>

10:15.110 --> 10:16.570
<b>What's that?</b>

10:17.150 --> 10:19.070
<b>Some kind of notebook?</b>

10:19.240 --> 10:21.620
<b>I'll tell you about it later.</b>

10:21.780 --> 10:23.950
<b>Tomorrow's the day.</b>

10:24.120 --> 10:27.040
<b>Let's get to bed early tonight.</b>

10:37.050 --> 10:39.380
<b>What's wrong? Is it your stomach?</b>

10:39.550 --> 10:41.180
<b>Nothing major.</b>

10:41.340 --> 10:42.550
<b>Happens all the time.</b>

10:43.390 --> 10:46.020
<b>It'll settle down soon.</b>

10:51.020 --> 10:55.190
<b>All right, Mr. Hei. If I don't come back by 2 a.m.--</b>

10:55.360 --> 10:58.320
<b>Yeah. I'll move as planned.</b>

11:01.910 --> 11:04.790
<b>So here's the plan.</b>

11:04.950 --> 11:09.040
<b>I'll enter the shop pretending to be a customer.</b>

11:10.080 --> 11:16.340
<b>I'm a traveler who can't forget
the taste of Masuya's sake.</b>

11:16.510 --> 11:20.180
<b>May I purchase however much this will get me?</b>

11:21.010 --> 11:22.220
<b>That much?</b>

11:22.800 --> 11:24.810
<b>Thank you for your patronage.</b>

11:24.970 --> 11:26.390
<b>Serve this man some tea!</b>

11:26.560 --> 11:29.230
<b>There's a lot of traffic at Masuya.</b>

11:29.390 --> 11:33.310
<b>I'll wait for the right moment
while I chat with the workers.</b>

11:33.730 --> 11:38.150
<b>As soon as the next customer arrives, it's showtime.</b>

11:38.990 --> 11:42.490
<b>Hello there. Welcome, Mr. Numata.</b>

11:43.410 --> 11:46.280
<b>I won't be in the workers' sight.</b>

11:46.450 --> 11:50.540
<b>I don't want to get in the way,
so I'll exit from the back door.</b>

11:57.420 --> 11:58.670
<b>Zenpachi,</b>

11:59.260 --> 12:02.300
<b>he made it in. Well done.</b>

12:03.390 --> 12:04.890
<b>It's Chugo.</b>

12:05.100 --> 12:06.680
<b>He's about to go play.</b>

12:06.850 --> 12:08.810
<b>Welcome, sir!</b>

12:10.600 --> 12:13.900
<b>He won't be going to sleep tonight, I'm sure.</b>

12:14.060 --> 12:18.900
<b>But, Chugo, the game I'm playing is a lot more fun.</b>

12:25.120 --> 12:26.910
<b>Keep quiet, all right?</b>

12:27.450 --> 12:30.660
<b>You're quite the master at this.</b>

12:33.080 --> 12:35.080
<b>I'm impressed, Zenpachi.</b>

12:35.250 --> 12:37.630
<b>You've got night vision like a cat.</b>

12:39.340 --> 12:42.170
<b>The money's stored here.</b>

12:42.340 --> 12:44.380
<b>How do we unlock it?</b>

12:44.550 --> 12:46.340
<b>That's a piece of cake.</b>

12:47.680 --> 12:51.180
<b>There, there. That's ought to do it.</b>

12:52.980 --> 12:55.480
<b>Way to go, old man.</b>

12:55.650 --> 12:59.320
<b>They call me the master of locks.</b>

13:01.360 --> 13:03.530
<b>This is a massive amount.</b>

13:03.700 --> 13:07.870
<b>That Ichigoro, he's stacked up for sure.</b>

13:08.030 --> 13:09.030
<b>What are you doing?</b>

13:09.910 --> 13:10.910
<b>That stinks.</b>

13:11.080 --> 13:15.170
<b>It's the lowlife's vault. It deserves to be disgraced.</b>

13:15.670 --> 13:19.170
<b>I've never met a thief like him.</b>

13:23.170 --> 13:27.840
<b>I could use two more pairs of hands,
don't you think?</b>

13:29.100 --> 13:30.810
<b>What are we waiting for?</b>

13:30.970 --> 13:33.850
<b>Let's get those kids out.</b>

13:35.190 --> 13:36.770
<b>So you were going to save them.</b>

13:37.600 --> 13:39.060
<b>Don't make me laugh.</b>

13:39.230 --> 13:41.610
<b>That's just how things unfolded.</b>

13:44.280 --> 13:46.530
<b>I'll take care of you again tonight.</b>

13:46.700 --> 13:48.990
<b>You've got a long night ahead of you.</b>

13:49.160 --> 13:51.370
<b>Stop! That's enough!</b>

13:51.530 --> 13:53.750
<b>Please, stop.</b>

13:53.910 --> 13:56.370
<b>I can't take this anymore.</b>

13:56.540 --> 13:57.870
<b>Hey, it's not your turn yet.</b>

13:59.080 --> 14:01.380
<b>Who the heck are you?</b>

14:03.960 --> 14:06.930
<b>Help us out, will you?</b>

14:20.730 --> 14:22.400
<b>They've noticed.</b>

14:23.320 --> 14:26.570
<b>Don't let the thieves escape! Capture them!</b>

14:26.740 --> 14:28.610
<b>Where are they?</b>

14:29.450 --> 14:31.570
<b>-How about there?
-Search it!</b>

14:32.740 --> 14:36.200
<b>Hey! What do you think you're doing
during this emergency?</b>

14:36.750 --> 14:39.580
<b>All of you, did the thieves come in here?</b>

14:39.750 --> 14:42.210
<b>-What?
-If they did, we would know.</b>

14:42.380 --> 14:44.380
<b>There are thieves?</b>

14:44.550 --> 14:45.670
<b>That's horrible.</b>

14:47.340 --> 14:48.680
<b>Where did they go?</b>

14:48.840 --> 14:52.640
<b>What are you doing? Get out and look for them!</b>

14:54.560 --> 14:57.560
<b>The coast is clear now.</b>

14:57.810 --> 14:58.810
<b>Thanks for that.</b>

14:58.980 --> 15:00.600
<b>You saved us.</b>

15:00.770 --> 15:01.770
<b>Of course.</b>

15:01.940 --> 15:03.110
<b>I felt good about it.</b>

15:03.770 --> 15:05.400
<b>Hey there.</b>

15:05.570 --> 15:08.110
<b>Promise me that you'll get away.</b>

15:09.280 --> 15:12.160
<b>Yeah, don't you worry.</b>

15:12.320 --> 15:16.660
<b>How did you know
that the servants would help us out?</b>

15:16.830 --> 15:22.130
<b>I know how it feels to be treated so poorly.
I've been there myself.</b>

15:27.710 --> 15:31.630
<b>-What are you doing?
-Just wait and see.</b>

15:33.300 --> 15:35.140
<b>A hidden pathway?</b>

15:35.310 --> 15:42.310
<b>Ichigoro must've built it so he could escape
during a fire or raid by himself.</b>

15:42.480 --> 15:45.440
<b>Over there! I heard something over there!</b>

15:45.610 --> 15:49.900
<b>Hurry. We'll be able to get out if we follow this path.</b>

15:59.580 --> 16:00.660
<b>What happened?</b>

16:04.500 --> 16:06.460
<b>Darn it.</b>

16:06.630 --> 16:09.130
<b>What? What are you missing?</b>

16:09.300 --> 16:13.180
<b>Sorry, Mr. Hei. Seems like I dropped something.</b>

16:13.760 --> 16:16.600
<b>Don't worry about me, just get out of here.</b>

16:44.040 --> 16:46.000
<b>Mr. Hei.</b>

16:50.800 --> 16:54.630
<b>Don't worry,
I gave them the light so they could get out.</b>

16:54.840 --> 16:56.470
<b>You've got good night vision.</b>

16:56.640 --> 17:01.140
<b>I'll be your legs, so be my eyes in exchange.</b>

17:09.690 --> 17:11.730
<b>Here's your cut.</b>

17:11.900 --> 17:13.530
<b>This much?</b>

17:13.700 --> 17:16.740
<b>Take that and run somewhere far away.</b>

17:17.200 --> 17:19.580
<b>Thank you very much. I can't thank you enough.</b>

17:19.740 --> 17:21.870
<b>-I'll never forget your kindness.
-Enough.</b>

17:22.040 --> 17:25.710
<b>No need to thank me. You better hurry now.</b>

17:28.590 --> 17:29.710
<b>What is it, boss?</b>

17:30.300 --> 17:32.210
<b>Doesn't it feel good?</b>

17:32.380 --> 17:35.720
<b>Stop it. Don't tease me.</b>

17:40.350 --> 17:43.520
<b>Keep searching! They can't be too far!</b>

17:44.270 --> 17:45.850
<b>"Secret Theft Tactics."</b>

17:46.020 --> 17:48.400
<b>Take a look.</b>

17:49.310 --> 17:51.270
<b>Hey, old man, this is--</b>

17:51.440 --> 17:54.780
<b>It tells you everything.
The best day to rob, how to unlock any lock,</b>

17:54.940 --> 17:57.280
<b>how to escape when you fail.</b>

17:57.450 --> 18:02.370
<b>I've recorded everything I learned as a thief.</b>

18:03.870 --> 18:05.620
<b>That's not all.</b>

18:05.790 --> 18:07.710
<b>From north to west, Oushu to Nagato,</b>

18:07.870 --> 18:11.460
<b>I've recorded the family traditions
and character traits of the owners</b>

18:11.630 --> 18:17.010
<b>and the number of servants they own at the 32 shops
and samurai estates I've targeted in the past.</b>

18:17.590 --> 18:19.760
<b>Seems like you haven't touched Edo.</b>

18:19.930 --> 18:22.390
<b>Edo is out of the question.</b>

18:22.560 --> 18:26.730
<b>Thanks to Onihei of Arson Theft Control.
He's a tenacious one.</b>

18:27.140 --> 18:30.980
<b>I suggest that you stay away from Edo too, Mr. Hei.</b>

18:31.150 --> 18:32.900
<b>So, what do you think?</b>

18:33.070 --> 18:35.900
<b>Will you accept this from me?</b>

18:36.070 --> 18:41.200
<b>But you know, old man, this is your asset, your soul.</b>

18:42.030 --> 18:44.830
<b>That's why I want you to have it.</b>

18:48.410 --> 18:50.830
<b>I don't have much time left.</b>

18:51.000 --> 18:54.170
<b>Maybe six months tops.</b>

18:54.340 --> 18:55.340
<b>I see.</b>

18:56.210 --> 19:01.510
<b>That explains why you, the lone thief,
were looking for a partner in crime.</b>

19:01.680 --> 19:05.930
<b>You wanted a successor to your art of theft.
Is that right?</b>

19:06.100 --> 19:07.430
<b>Precisely.</b>

19:07.600 --> 19:10.060
<b>But I wasn't looking for just anyone.</b>

19:10.690 --> 19:16.780
<b>Mr. Hei, if you could be my successor
when I'm gone, I, Zenpachi,</b>

19:16.940 --> 19:20.530
<b>my soul will live on inside you.</b>

19:20.820 --> 19:23.030
<b>That's what I think.</b>

19:23.200 --> 19:26.870
<b>Please, Mr. Hei. Please accept this.</b>

19:27.040 --> 19:28.620
<b>I beg you.</b>

19:29.710 --> 19:32.040
<b>Zenpachi.</b>

19:33.170 --> 19:34.170
<b>What's this?</b>

19:34.540 --> 19:40.630
<b>You're the thief who snuck into Masuya last night,
stole their money and kidnapped their servants.</b>

19:40.800 --> 19:42.890
<b>Surrender yourself and obey our commands!</b>

19:43.430 --> 19:45.180
<b>Have you got evidence to prove it?</b>

19:45.350 --> 19:48.520
<b>If you resist, we won't hesitate.</b>

19:49.100 --> 19:54.060
<b>Why don't I slaughter a few government officials
for a change?</b>

19:56.070 --> 19:57.940
<b>W-- Wait! Stop!</b>

19:58.820 --> 20:00.740
<b>What do you think you're doing?</b>

20:00.900 --> 20:06.450
<b>This is the chief of Arson Theft Control,
Heizo Hasegawa!</b>

20:07.910 --> 20:09.250
<b>O--? Onihei?</b>

20:09.410 --> 20:14.750
<b>Numata, let me tell you
that Zenpachi was with me last night.</b>

20:14.920 --> 20:17.250
<b>He couldn't have robbed Masuya.</b>

20:17.420 --> 20:18.550
<b>B-- But--</b>

20:18.710 --> 20:22.180
<b>Are you saying that you don't trust what I say?</b>

20:24.800 --> 20:28.180
<b>You're the one accepting bribes from Masuya,
am I right?</b>

20:36.270 --> 20:38.690
<b>I'm just a passing traveler today.</b>

20:38.860 --> 20:41.110
<b>I'll let you go just this once.</b>

20:41.780 --> 20:44.240
<b>Don't think you have another chance.</b>

20:44.780 --> 20:46.950
<b>Sorry, old man.</b>

20:47.120 --> 20:48.950
<b>I-- I can't stand.</b>

20:49.790 --> 20:51.950
<b>You're all healed now.</b>

20:53.080 --> 20:54.620
<b>Wow, I feel reborn!</b>

20:54.790 --> 20:57.290
<b>You must be God, doc!</b>

20:57.460 --> 20:58.880
<b>Glad you're healed, old man.</b>

21:02.340 --> 21:05.720
<b>If I'm going to be arrested,
I'd like to be arrested by you.</b>

21:05.890 --> 21:10.600
<b>I'll probably be gone
before I hear my sentence anyway.</b>

21:10.770 --> 21:14.270
<b>Actually, you're not even close to dying.</b>

21:14.640 --> 21:15.770
<b>Right, doctor?</b>

21:15.940 --> 21:19.770
<b>Yes, the pain in your stomach
is being caused by your feelings.</b>

21:20.270 --> 21:23.070
<b>It's all in your mind.</b>

21:24.110 --> 21:28.410
<b>You were consumed with the fear of death.</b>

21:28.570 --> 21:31.370
<b>That's the very source of the pain.</b>

21:31.540 --> 21:33.910
<b>Then how much longer do I have?!</b>

21:34.080 --> 21:38.170
<b>I'd say you'll live another 10 years, at least.</b>

21:38.330 --> 21:39.710
<b>Really?</b>

21:43.170 --> 21:46.340
<b>Thanks for the company on this journey.
Be well, old man.</b>

21:46.510 --> 21:50.220
<b>-Boss--
-But if we meet again, that means you're out of luck.</b>

21:51.470 --> 21:53.060
<b>Let's go, Chugo.</b>

21:53.220 --> 21:55.520
<b>You're really going to let me go?</b>

21:55.690 --> 21:57.810
<b>Mr. Hei! No, Mr. Hasegawa!</b>

21:57.980 --> 22:00.020
<b>What's that nonsense about?</b>

22:00.110 --> 22:02.190
<b>My name's Heizo Kimura!</b>

22:02.940 --> 22:06.030
<b>Goodbye, Mr. Hei!</b>

22:21.090 --> 22:27.300
<b>People are creatures born from dreams</b>

22:27.470 --> 22:33.140
<b>How can the sky look so blue?</b>

22:33.310 --> 22:39.100
<b>The past and future are just short-lived moments</b>

22:39.440 --> 22:44.860
<b>that exist between the blink of an eye</b>

22:47.820 --> 22:50.110
<b>Oh time…</b>

22:50.280 --> 22:54.120
<b>I could be a flower of spring</b>

22:54.290 --> 22:59.210
<b>in my next life</b>

23:00.000 --> 23:05.090
<b>And then…live on</b>

23:05.920 --> 23:11.300
<b>…and then…be loved</b>

23:12.010 --> 23:14.930
<b>La la la</b>

23:20.190 --> 23:23.610
<b>And then…cry</b>

23:26.940 --> 23:32.950
<b>…and then…fall</b>

23:41.420 --> 23:46.130
<b>The thief that was caught happened to be someone
Heizo had met when he was young.</b>

23:47.000 --> 23:48.670
<b>His sorrowful past is unveiled.</b>

23:50.050 --> 23:51.680
<b>Next on Onihei,
"Bottle-breaking Boy".</b>

23:51.840 --> 23:53.640
<b>Bottle-breaking Boy</b>
